<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The Docs tab (workspace/DocsScreen.kt, workspace/docs/). Every sentence is
  one of the iOS catalog's (Resources/Localizable.xcstrings), with its pt-BR
  value in values-pt-rBR/strings_docs.xml. Errors stay English.
  DocsRulesTest holds the selection words to fixtures/docs-values.json.

  The editor and the comments are DocsUI's (core-kit), which has no catalog:
  iOS looks its literal keys up in the app's catalog and shows the English
  for every key the catalog lacks, and shows a String it is handed verbatim.
  Those lines are translatable="false" here, so pt-BR reads them in English
  too, as on iOS.
-->
